              <td class="p-3.5 text-xs">2020 年前发布的旧款 Intel 架构 Mac</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-blue-50/40 transition">
              <td class="p-3.5 font-bold text-slate-900">Linux (Ubuntu / Debian)</td>
              <td class="p-3.5">x86_64</td>
              <td class="p-3.5 font-mono text-purple-600">_amd64.deb</td>
              <td class="p-3.5">Debian 二进制安装包，深度集成系统桌面</td>
              <td class="p-3.5 text-xs">Ubuntu, Linux Mint, Debian 开发者环境</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-blue-50/40 transition">
              <td class="p-3.5 font-bold text-slate-900">Linux (通用发行版)</td>
              <td class="p-3.5">x86_64</td>
              <td class="p-3.5 font-mono text-slate-800">_x86_64.AppImage</td>
              <td class="p-3.5">单文件免安装，赋予 +x 权限即可启动</td>
              <td class="p-3.5 text-xs">Fedora, openSUSE, 临时测试环境</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 深度技术专著章节 1 -->
    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 pb-3 border-b border-slate-200">
        一、黑产钓鱼链条揭秘：仿冒假官网与木马后门投毒技术
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
        自原作者停止维护原版 Clash 系列项目后，代理工具领域爆发了大规模的黑产钓鱼欺诈。不法分子通过购买搜索引擎排名、抢注近似域名等手段，搭建高度相似的假冒官方下载站。
      </p>
      <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
        这些带有后门的改装客户端通常具有以下严重危害：
      </p>
      <ul class="text-sm text-slate-600 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
        <li><strong>植入恶意反向代理劫持：</strong> 修改内核内置的分流规则，将网银、加密货币交易平台（Binance、OKX）的访问请求劫持至假冒钓鱼网关；</li>
        <li><strong>读取浏览器会话凭证：</strong> 启动后直接遍历本地 Chrome、Edge 的 User Data 目录，提取已登录网站的 Session Cookie 并静默回传至 C2 服务器；</li>
        <li><strong>肉鸡网络背景常驻：</strong> 利用用户的真实宽带作为黑客发起跨国分布式拒绝服务攻击（DDoS）的僵尸网络节点。</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base mt-3">
        <strong>防范基准：</strong> 唯一且纯净的官方开源项目地址为 <code>github.com/clash-verge-rev/clash-verge-rev</code>。除 GitHub Releases 外，切勿轻信任何声称是「官网独家首发」的下载链接。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 深度技术专著章节 2 -->
    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 pb-3 border-b border-slate-200">
        二、SHA-256 哈希校验实战：如何验证文件的唯一数字指纹
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
        SHA-256（安全散列算法）是一种单向密码学散列函数。任何文件哪怕只被修改了一个比特位，其计算出的 64 位十六进制哈希值就会发生彻底的雪崩变化。因此，通过比对官方发布的哈希值，可以 100% 确保安装包未被植入木马。
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-4 my-6 not-prose">
        <div class="p-5 bg-slate-900 text-slate-200 rounded-xl font-mono text-xs">
          <div class="text-slate-400 mb-2"># Windows 环境下使用 PowerShell 进行文件哈希校验</div>
          <div class="text-cyan-400">Get-FileHash -Algorithm SHA256 "C:\Users\Downloads\Clash.Verge_1.7.7_x64_setup.exe"</div>
          <div class="text-slate-400 mt-2"># 输出示例：</div>
          <div>Algorithm       Hash</div>
          <div>---------       ----</div>
          <div class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">SHA256          A3F9C7D4E5B8... (核对与 GitHub 官方 SHA256SUMS.txt 是否一致)</div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 bg-slate-900 text-slate-200 rounded-xl font-mono text-xs">
          <div class="text-slate-400 mb-2"># macOS 环境下使用终端核验 SHA-256</div>
          <div class="text-cyan-400">shasum -a 256 ~/Downloads/Clash.Verge_1.7.7_aarch64.dmg</div>
          <div class="text-emerald-400 font-bold mt-1">b4d2e8...  /Users/.../Clash.Verge_1.7.7_aarch64.dmg</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 商业推荐高转化卡片（光速云） -->
    {guangsuBrand && (
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-800 to-blue-950 text-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 mb-12 shadow-xl border border-slate-700/60 relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute -right-10 -bottom-10 w-64 h-64 bg-blue-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none" />
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-6">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-black tracking-wider uppercase bg-amber-400 text-slate-950">
              #1 专线品牌首选
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">与正版 Clash Verge 深度契合</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-right">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">起步轻量专线: </span>
            <span class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-amber-400">¥8.25</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">/月 (年付 ¥99/年 69GB/月)</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-white">
          光速云 (GuangSu Cloud) — 安装完毕后的最佳专线订阅伙伴
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-3xl">
          成功下载正版 Clash Verge Rev 之后，必须配合纯净高速的专线订阅才能建立连接。光速云 6 年稳定运营，提供全节点 VLESS 企业内网 IEPL 专线，后台支持一键自动导入客户端，彻底规避繁琐设置。
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 mb-8">
          <div class="p-3 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-xl">
            <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">专线类型</div>
            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-white mt-1">企业级 IEPL/IPLC</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-[11px] p-3 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-xl">
            <div class="text-slate-400">订阅格式</div>
            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-400 mt-1">原生 Clash 订阅</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-[11px] p-3 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-xl">
            <div class="text-slate-400">专属特惠码</div>
            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-400 mt-1 font-mono">AMM</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-[11px] p-3 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-xl">
            <div class="text-slate-400">永久套餐</div>
            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-white mt-1">¥147 永久 247GB</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4">
          <a
            href={guangsuBrand.affiliateUrl}
            target="_blank"
            rel="nofollow sponsored noopener"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white font-bold rounded-xl text-center text-sm shadow-lg shadow-blue-600/30 transition transform hover:-translate-y-0.5"
          >
            前往光速云官网一键获取订阅 ➜
          </a>
          <a
            href={`/brands/${guangsuBrand.slug}/`}
            class="w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3.5 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-slate-200 font-semibold rounded-xl text-center text-sm border border-white/10 transition"
          >
            查阅光速云 2026 深度实测
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4">
          <AffiliateNotice />
        </div>
      </div>
    )}

    <!-- 关联核心长文模块 -->
    {relatedArticles.length > 0 && (
      <div class="mb-14">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
          <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">
            📖 推荐阅读：客户端正版下载与配置完整攻略
          </h2>
          <a href="/articles/" class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-blue-600 hover:underline">
            查看全部精选文章 ➜
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          {relatedArticles.map((article) => (
            <ArticleCard
              title={article.data.title}
              description={article.data.description}
              url={`/articles/${article.id}/`}
              cover={article.data.cover}
              category={article.data.category}
              pubDate={article.data.pubDate}
              readingTime={article.data.readingTime}
              author={article.data.author}
            />
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    )}

    <!-- FAQ 手风琴模块 -->
    <div class="mb-14">
      <div class="mb-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">
          ❓ 常见问题解答 (FAQ) — 正版下载与安装包选型避坑
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">
          整理自官方社区高频提问，涵盖 Windows 拦截、Mac 权限与安全校验方案
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        {faqs.map((f, idx) => (
          <details class="group bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xs transition">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 sm:p-5 text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-slate-900 cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-50/80 transition select-none">
              <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-blue-600 text-xs font-mono">Q{idx + 1}</span>
                <span>{f.question}</span>
              </span>
              <span class="text-slate-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-200">
                ▾
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-4 pb-4 sm:px-5 sm:pb-5 pt-1 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/40">
              {f.answer}
            </div>
          </details>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 底部回到门户与集群索引 -->
    <div class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-8 mt-12 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-slate-500">
      <div>
        <span>本页属于：</span>
        <a href="/clash/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline font-semibold">Clash 与开源代理客户端专题专栏</a>
        <span> · 涵盖 7 个垂直细分领域</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <a href="/clash/verge-subscribe/" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition">下一专题：Clash Verge 订阅导入指南 ➜</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
